Third-party data
----------------

Map data (apps/game/public/city/ and apps/game/public/data/)
  © OpenStreetMap contributors. Available under the Open Database Licence
  (ODbL) 1.0. https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

Building heights (baked into apps/game/public/city/*/t_*.json)
  GHS-BUILT-H R2023A, 2018 epoch. European Commission, Joint Research Centre
  (JRC). CC BY 4.0.
  https://human-settlement.emergency.copernicus.eu/download.php?ds=buH

Terrain (apps/game/public/city/*/hills.json)
  Terrain Tiles on AWS Open Data, from Mapzen/Tilezen, built from SRTM (NASA)
  and other public sources. https://registry.opendata.aws/terrain-tiles/

World outline (apps/game/src/look/world.json)
  Natural Earth (public domain), via world-atlas (ISC licence).

Weather (fetched while playing, not stored here)
  Open-Meteo. CC BY 4.0. https://open-meteo.com/

